{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6a959e351dc418c89bb110b58d88e3c7cd31e65e13c158e3bf1c070d87df635",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8baf09896c9f991b3db8296f9d5cfe2375fea7e10b1b5d88dfbb9054f30a563",
      "text": "星座与占卜与海南鸡饭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8939c28b6303cce2c2ed80052420dc42e3c12fe7c966b36cdf921e1b87b1e04",
      "text": "接下了与女性向杂志的星座占卜联动的\n工作的春名、涟、雨彦。\n在雨彦试图向对星座和占卜都毫无兴趣的\n涟进行说明时，\n春名试着念出了涟的星座运势，然而……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3bd4b94ccc07076bcf1055f6b600e5c9372f0c31cff6d08c458f7cc3eed545f",
      "text": "FES",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8baf09896c9f991b3db8296f9d5cfe2375fea7e10b1b5d88dfbb9054f30a563",
      "text": "星座与占卜与海南鸡饭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3637744369bc0f88b040d862200b64acd33701365dc0a1a32d622dcf997baa9",
      "text": "这次的工作，是与女性向杂志的\n星座占卜专栏进行联动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ff45741fb993936c132f97ecf4d8ce737277b4e56bbde081cbe2e205118fc6",
      "text": "各位要穿上与自己星座相关的服装，\n进行平面硬照拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d11bcd15a0d6978e84da5136fd77d2b6eb2f7de67606fe470fd6c676f2f0de46",
      "text": "那算什么，听起来好无聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a42b10c22f2fa97011c9e1fd1725aace4bcd4cd2c39811c1dc6222e1de87e140",
      "text": "别这么说嘛。占星术这种东西，顾名思义\n就是从星辰的位置来解读人的运势与吉凶，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b25eff4d20f025837b92539fef2ec28bb62a1fbe089dd23b914c3506e188c41",
      "text": "占卜的人视角不同，哪怕看同样的星座或星宿\n也会得出不同结果。对比起来看，其实挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bd0369f15fa6510a96d96e53dd0e2b30b3d1e28a380d6953ab5913e4994181",
      "text": "啊，涟的星座上面是这么写的哦！\n“本周是幸运周！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b454eb228c0c96272ddb6140f8b617f234eee55cc7b7147c044f8bdfce649ad9",
      "text": "少在那嘀嘀咕咕尽扯些听不懂的鬼话。\n大～笨蛋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe15b1623adbe819f811ce2b08016624f3fa934c6853915f2e13b1bb60004cf",
      "text": "“去吃海南鸡饭的话，会变得更开心\n吧”……上面这么写着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ef85fa784ae4cfee59d3f029fd48daa082ee7c65a3e76ebb936b0348f8004e",
      "text": "海……南……那是什么玩意，好吃吗？\n要是好吃就赶紧给我端上来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a410f3ae3d097dbfcca2612cb115949a8fcdf612d7d7d9dab4c54f27666df43",
      "text": "哈哈……照这样下去真的没问题吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d175f6fdc23435933c6de36d76b5587950d6e403c1da76a4c8e2e94162dfa0c",
      "text": "牙崎是关键时刻靠得住的家伙。\n我们也不能输给他，好好努力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
